WEBVTT

00:18:28.667 --> 00:18:32.768
When he was 26, the startup he worked for
was acquired by a big company.

00:18:32.792 --> 00:18:35.976
Almost overnight, he became
director of product development.

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:38.143
He found himself
giving regular presentations

00:18:38.167 --> 00:18:39.434
to senior executives,

00:18:39.458 --> 00:18:41.976
and every time he expected to bomb.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:44.559
AR: I was completely
underskilled for the task at hand

00:18:44.583 --> 00:18:47.018
and there was a restroom downstairs.

00:18:47.042 --> 00:18:49.101
It was the classic cold water on the face,

00:18:49.125 --> 00:18:52.851
feeling lightheaded and feeling nauseous,
hanging over the sink for dear life.

00:18:52.875 --> 00:18:55.476
AG: Alexi was afraid
he could get fired at any moment

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.143
for saying the wrong thing,

00:18:57.167 --> 00:18:59.559
so he made sure to keep saying yes,

00:18:59.583 --> 00:19:02.143
even to things
he didn't feel qualified for.